  "validation_scope": "Production PP and physical NAO carried unchanged from the Si64 G0W0 campaign; the auxiliary basis is a preset .abfs that the record consumes through STRU ABFS_ORBITAL, not a PCA product generated in-run. One calculation used the set: the 64-atom simple-cubic Si G0W0 sampled-path gap. Transferred to another cell, k mesh or PP/NAO pair, it is an untested starting point, not a validated recommendation.",
